{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Brie Parmesan Mysteries",
    "steam_appid": 2340670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/9c4d77055f56b4a662f001d5b096e212.poster.avif?t=1723837994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/9c4d77055f56b4a662f001d5b096e212.webm?t=1723837994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/9c4d77055f56b4a662f001d5b096e212.mp4?t=1723837994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take on the role of private eye Brie Parmesan, the best rat detective in Chicatgo, as he outwits and outmaneuvers the Cat Meowfia and other obstacles to uncover evidence and solve the case. Avoid detection as you navigate your way through the streets and speakeasies of Chicatgo in search of the smoking gun that will bring the Cat Meowfia down for good. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/cc00d5dcfccf0cabe725bb0838fdfe1d.avif?t=1723837994\" /></span><br>The Cat Meowfia has taken control of milk production and it's up to you to put a stop to it. Follow the trail of evidence through multiple locations to collect clues, cheese, and powerups and grind their operations to a halt. Along the way find hidden caches and uncover new areas to help you on your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/e1524208bcb3dbe57d3aca13406c4c79.avif?t=1723837994\" /></span><br>The Meowfia runs the streets of Chicatgo, so watch out for guards and bosses. Stay out of their line of sight and keep the noise down. If they catch you you\u2019ll be swimming with the fishes\u2026 <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/e810f3fc0a2a3e9fb2e5fcc0cce12838.avif?t=1723837994\" /></span><br>Run, jump, or sneak your way past guards, pick locks to get to secure locations, collect cheese, and ultimately collect enough evidence to unlock new locations and solve the case.<br><br>Play as Brie Parmesan in this isometric stealth adventure. Brie Parmesan Mysteries combines elements of classic stealth and collectible gameplay with a charming Art Deco style and brooding atmosphere to bring players a fresh and entertaining gaming experience with a pinch of humour. Pick locks and sneak past guards to find enough hidden evidence to unlock new locations and solve the case. Trade cheese to back-alley characters for power-ups and add to your evidence count at the end of each level. Find just enough collectibles to advance the case or go back for seconds and experience it all.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/9c4d77055f56b4a662f001d5b096e212.poster.avif?t=1723837994\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/9c4d77055f56b4a662f001d5b096e212.webm?t=1723837994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/9c4d77055f56b4a662f001d5b096e212.mp4?t=1723837994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take on the role of private eye Brie Parmesan, the best rat detective in Chicatgo, as he outwits and outmaneuvers the Cat Meowfia and other obstacles to uncover evidence and solve the case. Avoid detection as you navigate your way through the streets and speakeasies of Chicatgo in search of the smoking gun that will bring the Cat Meowfia down for good. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/cc00d5dcfccf0cabe725bb0838fdfe1d.avif?t=1723837994\" /></span><br>The Cat Meowfia has taken control of milk production and it's up to you to put a stop to it. Follow the trail of evidence through multiple locations to collect clues, cheese, and powerups and grind their operations to a halt. Along the way find hidden caches and uncover new areas to help you on your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/e1524208bcb3dbe57d3aca13406c4c79.avif?t=1723837994\" /></span><br>The Meowfia runs the streets of Chicatgo, so watch out for guards and bosses. Stay out of their line of sight and keep the noise down. If they catch you you\u2019ll be swimming with the fishes\u2026 <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340670/extras/e810f3fc0a2a3e9fb2e5fcc0cce12838.avif?t=1723837994\" /></span><br>Run, jump, or sneak your way past guards, pick locks to get to secure locations, collect cheese, and ultimately collect enough evidence to unlock new locations and solve the case.<br><br>Play as Brie Parmesan in this isometric stealth adventure. Brie Parmesan Mysteries combines elements of classic stealth and collectible gameplay with a charming Art Deco style and brooding atmosphere to bring players a fresh and entertaining gaming experience with a pinch of humour. Pick locks and sneak past guards to find enough hidden evidence to unlock new locations and solve the case. Trade cheese to back-alley characters for power-ups and add to your evidence count at the end of each level. Find just enough collectibles to advance the case or go back for seconds and experience it all.",
    "short_description": "Sneak past guards, follow the cheese, find evidence in this isometric stealth adventure. Play as Brie Parmesan, a master detective and a rat working to undermine the criminal underworld of Chicatgo. Can you find enough evidence to solve case and bring the Cat Meowfia to justice?",
